### Roteiro para o HTTP Client do IntelliJ (servidor em http://localhost:8080/api)

### 1. Login (guarda o token)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@authserver.com", "password": "admin" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Criar categoria / curso / estudante (públicos)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Backend" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Kotlin com Spring", "workload": 40, "categoryId": 1 }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "ana@email.com" }

### 3. Associar estudante ao curso
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": 1, "courseId": 1 }

### 4. Consultas com filtro e ordenação
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses?title=kotlin&minWorkload=20&sortBy=workload&sortDir=DESC

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?name=ana&sortBy=email

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments?studentId=1&status=ACTIVE&sortBy=course

### 5. Ações destrutivas SEM token -> 401
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1

### 6. Ações destrutivas COM token
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/category/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "COMPLETED" }

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
